  "label": "User projected onto the man as the subject of the false accusation",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the man (VisualMaterial) through the self-referential textual accusation 'i'm a serial pedofile'. The text directly addresses the man as the entity making the accusation, creating a deictic link where the user imagines themselves as the man being falsely accused. This projection is central to the meme's hateful intent, as it forces the viewer to identify with the victim of the false accusation, thereby internalizing the stereotype and hate speech.",
